      "annotations": {
        "title": "Capture Fingerprint"
      },
      "description": "Read what the running browser shows a page, as a fingerprint: the navigator, Client Hints, screen, time zone, WebGL, media devices and more, plus readings no setting holds (webdriver flag, plugins, canvas and audio hashes, headless markers). Optionally opens url first and saves the fingerprint as a file. An https page or about:blank gives the whole fingerprint; an http page has no Client Hints or media devices.",
